PARITY (web AddAnnotationPopover.tsx -> native), no scope narrowing
==================================================================================
  Data sources (web -> native P1/S8 seam):
    useTranslation              -> AddAnnotationStrings facade (P1/S10), no literals.
    timestamp prop              -> AddAnnotationDraftContext.timestamp (source-owned).
    editableDate prop           -> AddAnnotationDraftContext.editableDate.
    onAdd(label,cat,desc?,occAt)-> AddAnnotationController.submit(draft:).
    onCancel                    -> AddAnnotationController.cancel().
  Date helpers (verbatim port, UTC):
    toDateInputValue(ts)        -> AddAnnotationDateValue.inputValue(fromTimestamp:) — empty
                                   for empty; UTC YYYY-MM-DD for ISO/bare-date; shape-valid
                                   string accepted verbatim when unparseable (web's own
                                   "accept verbatim" branch); empty for unparseable text.
    toIsoTimestamp(date)        -> AddAnnotationDateValue.isoTimestamp(fromInputValue:) — pins
                                   YYYY-MM-DD to ...T00:00:00Z, empty for empty/malformed.
  Composition (web Modal/form -> native):
    Modal title "Add Annotation"-> header title + freshness chip + close "×".
    editableDate ? date input   -> AddAnnotationDateField (DatePicker .date, in: ...today,
      : read-only timestamp        String<->Date bridge keeping the YYYY-MM-DD shape) /
                                   AddAnnotationTimestampRow (web fixed-date text).
    label <Input maxLength=50>  -> AddAnnotationTextField (cap 50, autofocus-equivalent).
    category pills (6)          -> AddAnnotationCategoryPills over a wrapping FlowLayout; each
      icon + ANNOTATION_COLORS     pill = SF Symbol (Flag->flag.fill, Wrench->wrench…, MapPin->
      selected tint                mappin.circle, AlertTriangle->exclamationmark.triangle,
                                   ArrowUpCircle->arrow.up.circle, Tag->tag.fill) + the
                                   verbatim ANNOTATION_COLORS hex tint when selected.
    description <Input max=200> -> AddAnnotationTextField (cap 200).
    Button ghost Cancel         -> TSButton(.ghost) -> handleClose (reset + onCancel + dismiss).
    Button primary Add (disabled-> TSButton(.primary) .disabled(!canSubmit) -> handleSubmit
      when !label.trim())          (validate + onAdd + reset + dismiss).
    handleSubmit reset fields   -> model.submit() clears label/category/description to web
                                   defaults (''/'milestone'/'').
  Tailwind classes were NOT ported; chrome is P1/S9 tokens (TSSpacing/TSRadius/Color.TS/
  Font.TS) via TSGlassPanel/TSFadeIn/TSButton.

==================================================================================
STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces)
==================================================================================
  loading  -> AddAnnotationLoadingState (spinner + "Preparing annotation…").
  empty    -> AddAnnotationEmptyState (ContentUnavailableView "No point selected to
              annotate") — guards the no-editable-date + unparseable-timestamp edge.
  error    -> AddAnnotationErrorState (QueryError-equivalent + Retry -> model.refresh()).
  stale    -> freshness chip "Stale" + connectivity banner + ONE guarded auto-refresh.
  offline  -> freshness chip "Offline" + banner; cached context kept; no refetch.
  content  -> the populated form (+ inline reload error if a refresh failed while a cached
              context remains).
  Telemetry: model.start() emits P1/S11 view.opened surface="AddAnnotationPopover" (once,
  idempotent — ModelTests proven).

